The country calendars and their weekend-substitution rules were derived from
and verified against the python-holidays library
(https://github.com/vacanza/holidays) by its authors and contributors, which is
distributed under the MIT License. The dates themselves are public law in each
country; this crate is an independent reimplementation for Rust and shares no
code with it.

